                <pb facs="1450" n="1346" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1346"/>

                <head>Arbitration Convention of January 9, 1909, between the United States and
                    Uruguay: text</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, January 9, 1909; ratification
                        advised by the Senate, January IS, 1909; ratified by the President, March 1,
                        1909; ratified by Uruguay, June 27, 1913; ratifications exchanged at
                        Washington, November 14, 1913; proclaimed, November 15, 1913.</hi>
                </p>

